# S68 flat: from the state's standstill, gas and brake held together (the original's reverse below
# speed 5), and once it is rolling backwards the stick hard right with both still held. Wall-clock, at
# a quarter speed (4 ms here is 1 ms ridden).
sleep 4000
down square
down cross
sleep 12000
stick l 1 0
sleep 28000
release
